            "block_content": "Agreement on pairwise ranking exceeds agreement on exact scores: the evaluators differed in severity on several dimensions, and one repeatedly noted scope asymmetries between complete papers and shorter theory-section excerpts. The numerical differences are therefore descriptive, and the unanimous pairwise ordering is the more stable result.",
